## 🛎️ Monitoring & Alerting

`KLM-MONITOR01` provides infrastructure monitoring using **Uptime Kuma**.

The monitoring system is intended to provide visibility into:

- Host availability
- Network reachability
- Infrastructure service availability
- VM/service outages

Additional automation can be implemented using PowerShell and VMware PowerCLI.

Potential future monitoring includes:

- VM power-state monitoring
- ESXi host connectivity
- Datastore capacity
- vCenter service health
- VM availability
- Automated SMTP alerting

Monitoring and alerting are treated as part of the broader infrastructure automation and observability design.

