## 💡 Why This Project?

The project is designed to simulate a **production-style private cloud and enterprise infrastructure environment** while remaining suitable for laboratory experimentation.

The primary objectives include:

- Designing and building an enterprise-style virtualization environment
- Managing VMware vCenter and ESXi infrastructure
- Working with Active Directory-integrated infrastructure
- Testing shared storage and VM mobility
- Practicing disaster recovery procedures
- Experimenting with DRS and vMotion
- Testing host patching and upgrade procedures
- Developing infrastructure monitoring and alerting
- Automating infrastructure tasks with PowerShell and PowerCLI
- Learning enterprise networking and storage concepts
- Maintaining technical documentation and repeatable procedures

The environment is intentionally allowed to evolve as new technologies, hardware, and experiments are introduced.

